# Repository environment configuration.
#
# This is structured text (KST). It holds portable per-mount policy;
# source locations, grants, runtime status, and service details never belong here.
#
# Per-mount refresh override. The last matching mount section is active.
# refresh values: manual | event
# mount global
#   refresh event
# mount global
#   refresh manual
#
# Writable access is not configured here. It requires a signed source-owned
# syncGrant in the source environment configuration and `kero-host mount sync`.
# KERO_HOME, install paths, PATH entries, service ports, and source paths are
# host-local facts and must not be committed in this repository.
